ordinal":343273,"en":"I would die from his hands."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0617:b002:l008","ordinal":343274,"en":"In a hurry,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0617:b002:l009","ordinal":343275,"en":"I would die badly."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0617:b002:l010","ordinal":343276,"en":"Semetey ran away,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0617:b002:l011","ordinal":343277,"en":"Aram would die."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0617:b002:l012","ordinal":343278,"en":"The tower fell and a shot was fired."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0617:b002:l013","ordinal":343279,"en":"I would die from the fortress."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0617:b002:l014","ordinal":343280,"en":"Semetey ran away from the bully."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0617:b002:l015","ordinal":343281,"en":"I would die of speech."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0617:b002:l016","ordinal":343282,"en":"A huge roar,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0617:b002:l017","ordinal":343283,"en":"I would have died from the sound,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0617:b002:l018","ordinal":343284,"en":"Sarybai slaughtered the people,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0617:b002:l019","ordinal":343285,"en":"So he did this - saying,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0617:b002:l020","ordinal":343286,"en":"I would have died from the noise."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0617:b002:l021","ordinal":343287,"en":"Bad name is the most difficult,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0617:b002:l022","ordinal":343288,"en":"I would die from the sound."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0617:b002:l023","ordinal":343289,"en":"Don't stop if you slip"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0617:b002:l024","ordinal":343290,"en":"I was about to leave the country,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0617:b002:l025","ordinal":343291,"en":"Many people were shocked."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0617:b002:l026","ordinal":343292,"en":"I was going to die."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0617:b002:l027","ordinal":343293,"en":"Sarybay, son of a monster"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0617:b002:l028","ordinal":343294,"en":"I would die of disbelief."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0617:b002:l029","ordinal":343295,"en":"Fourteen horses were taken yesterday,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0617:b